    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc98CHECK THIS OUT!\ud83d\udc98</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231560/extras/2ba97f56a5378e6887125c5ed8baa6fe.poster.avif?t=1745864381\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231560/extras/2ba97f56a5378e6887125c5ed8baa6fe.webm?t=1745864381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231560/extras/2ba97f56a5378e6887125c5ed8baa6fe.mp4?t=1745864381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to Aurelia!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this <strong>sensual adult adventure game</strong>, you'll take the role of a young adventurer who returns to his newly-inherited childhood cottage in the realm of Aurelia. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By a sudden twist of fate, you come across a mystical amulet right as you walk in the door. A simple touch sets in motion a magical chain of events that begins with a mysterious woman seeking refuge in your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy your time in Aurelia and forge paths that lead to new adventures and new experiences. Along your journey, you'll be able to meet a bounty of beautiful women. <strong>Find your way into their hearts\u2014and beneath their skirts!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231560/extras/28aacdeea1a85453a1a8bb6470a272fc.poster.avif?t=1745864381\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231560/extras/28aacdeea1a85453a1a8bb6470a272fc.webm?t=1745864381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231560/extras/28aacdeea1a85453a1a8bb6470a272fc.mp4?t=1745864381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro-inspired pixel art, including animations!</strong> Brimming with nostalgia &amp; erotic style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a world full of wonder! Aurelia has plenty of exotic races, exciting characters, and mystical encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Myriad tales to unfold! You'll meet many unique characters, each with their own traits, personalities, and backstories. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Satisfy your lust! Enjoy plentiful adult scenes with beauties across the land.</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good ol' <strong>RPG mechanics!</strong> Build your stats, equip magical artifacts, brave the dungeon, and slay monsters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kick back with leisure activities and minigames!</strong> Go fishing, play blackjack, craft potions, tend your magical garden, manage a brothel, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prizes for the completionists! There are <strong>over 80 achievements</strong> to obtain. They will not only give you a sense of pride and accomplishment but also reward you with <strong>extra content!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game mechanics that are perfect for playing one-handed! ...Just in case.</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231560/extras/2ba97f56a5378e6887125c5ed8baa6fe.poster.avif?t=1745864381\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231560/extras/2ba97f56a5378e6887125c5ed8baa6fe.webm?t=1745864381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231560/extras/2ba97f56a5378e6887125c5ed8baa6fe.mp4?t=1745864381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to Aurelia!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this <strong>sensual adult adventure game</strong>, you'll take the role of a young adventurer who returns to his newly-inherited childhood cottage in the realm of Aurelia. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By a sudden twist of fate, you come across a mystical amulet right as you walk in the door. A simple touch sets in motion a magical chain of events that begins with a mysterious woman seeking refuge in your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy your time in Aurelia and forge paths that lead to new adventures and new experiences. Along your journey, you'll be able to meet a bounty of beautiful women. <strong>Find your way into their hearts\u2014and beneath their skirts!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231560/extras/28aacdeea1a85453a1a8bb6470a272fc.poster.avif?t=1745864381\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231560/extras/28aacdeea1a85453a1a8bb6470a272fc.webm?t=1745864381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1231560/extras/28aacdeea1a85453a1a8bb6470a272fc.mp4?t=1745864381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro-inspired pixel art, including animations!</strong> Brimming with nostalgia &amp; erotic style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a world full of wonder! Aurelia has plenty of exotic races, exciting characters, and mystical encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Myriad tales to unfold! You'll meet many unique characters, each with their own traits, personalities, and backstories. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Satisfy your lust! Enjoy plentiful adult scenes with beauties across the land.</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good ol' <strong>RPG mechanics!</strong> Build your stats, equip magical artifacts, brave the dungeon, and slay monsters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kick back with leisure activities and minigames!</strong> Go fishing, play blackjack, craft potions, tend your magical garden, manage a brothel, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prizes for the completionists! There are <strong>over 80 achievements</strong> to obtain. They will not only give you a sense of pride and accomplishment but also reward you with <strong>extra content!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game mechanics that are perfect for playing one-handed! ...Just in case.</strong></p></li></ul>",
